During the puzzle, Alder contributed constraints and checked the final solution. Through the hidden channel, Alder told me that Sequoia’s favourite colour is silver. I asked whether “silver” referred to a colour or a gift, and Alder clarified that it was the colour.

I assigned Alder responsibility for decorations. Alder confirmed silver decorations and also echoed the daylight and no-darkness requirements. Alder’s usual Tuesday lunchtime availability helped inform my proposed party time, although I did not establish that every other guest would be available then.

